 * "Beim Kauf" itself is intentionally absent below — per the
 * workbook's note it's an internal sub-category condition, not a
 * checkbox and not a heading, so no term or Group value is ever
 * created for it. Its three real options ("Finanzierung gesichert",
 * "Eigenkapital vorhanden", "Kauf ohne Finanzierung möglich") ARE
